# State Management Rules (MST + MMKV)

- Define stores using `types.model(...)` with explicit types and defaults.
- Place views in `.views((self) => ({}))` and actions in `.actions((self) => ({}))`.
- Register stores into `RootStore` in `packages/core/src/store/index.tsx`.
- Persistent stores are hydrated from MMKV on initialization and saved on snapshot change.
- Never place UI component state inside global stores; use ViewModel local hook state for screen-specific UI state.
